<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 194,586.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 194,586.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of March 5 totaled 194,586 bales, up from 193,750 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 836 bales issued, no decertification orders, no cancellations, and 3,835 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
